{
  "schema":"SOMA-LLD-TYPES-V2",
  "lld_id":"LLD-06",
  "type_rules":["Mutating request bodies use COMMAND_ENVELOPE_V1 and resolve exact command inputs from the named command contract; Customer compatibility and accepted source chronology are always reread from owner interfaces rather than trusted from client payloads.","Percentages/durations are transported in exact policy-defined decimal/rational forms and never binary-floating authority."],
